     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Data Scientist at TGS<span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"right\" dir=\"RTL\"><b><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"text-align:left\"><b><i><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">About TGS<u></u><u></u></span></i></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Travel Global Systems (TGS), headquartered in Tel Aviv\r\nwith a wing in Romania, focuses on providing innovative and affordable travel\r\ntechnology solutions for Travel Holdings, Inc.&#39;s brands and its partners. <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">TGS was established in 2002, and provides B2B and B2C\r\nsoftware solutions for handling large volume transactions and reservations\r\nwithin the travel industry.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">The front-office and back-office TGS systems uniquely\r\ninterface to emphasize yield management, speed, and simplicity for suppliers\r\nand agents.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">TGS has developed patent-pending technology that\r\nprovides instant inventory management; and pricing and accounting functionality\r\nfor suppliers and clients - saving time and money reconciling accounts.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"text-align:left\"><b><i><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Job Description</span></i></b><b><i><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></i></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">The Data Scientist will lead analytics projects and\r\nwill be responsible for architecting and implementing statistical,</span><b><i><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></i></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">data mining, optimization, and machine learning\r\nmodels.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"text-align:left\"><b><i><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Required Technical and Professional Expertise\r\n <u></u><u></u></span></i></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt 22.5pt;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:7pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;\">        \r\n</span></span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Obtained </span><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:#28333b\">BS.c or </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"> Master’s\r\n in Statistics, Applied Mathematics, Engineering, Operations Research,\r\nComputer Science, or other quantitative discipline</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt 22.5pt;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:7pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;\">        \r\n</span></span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Expertise with advanced statistical or mathematical analyses (e.g.,\r\nmachine learning, predictive analytics, optimization, data mining)</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt 22.5pt;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:7pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;\">        \r\n</span></span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Experience using one or more statistical programs (e.g., R, SPSS)</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt 22.5pt;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:7pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;\">        \r\n</span></span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:#28333b\">Have extensive\r\nexperience troubleshooting and solving complex technical problems</span><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"> </span><span lang=\"HE\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt 22.5pt;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:7pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;\">        \r\n</span></span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Experience cleaning, restructuring, and merging large datasets<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt 22.5pt;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:7pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;\">        \r\n</span></span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Experience creating compelling data visualizations of statistical\r\nanalyses<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt 22.5pt;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:7pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;\">        \r\n</span></span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Ability to program in one or more languages (Python, SQL)  <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt 22.5pt;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:7pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;\">        \r\n</span></span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Have 1+ years of experience</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><b><i><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Besides that</span></i></b><b><i><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><u></u><u></u></span></i></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:7pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;\">        \r\n</span></span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Have tremendous communication skills</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:7pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;\">        \r\n</span></span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Be a great team player</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:7pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;\">        \r\n</span></span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Be very independent and very organized</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:7pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;\">        \r\n</span></span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Perfect English</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:7pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;\">        \r\n</span></span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Have a business understanding</span><span lang=\"HE\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt 0.25in;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:7pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;\">        \r\n</span></span><